<title>USA: USDA--1997 county loan rates for wheat,barley,oats.</title>
<headline>USDA--1997 county loan rates for wheat,barley,oats.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Wednesday announced 1997-crop county loan rates for wheat, barley and oats in dollars per bushel.</p>
<p>    COMMODITY	 NATIONAL AVERAGE LOAN RATES</p>
<p>    Wheat		     $2.58/bu</p>
<p>    Barley		    $1.57/bu</p>
<p>    Oats			$1.11/bu</p>
</text>
